:: Event - Medicine mob [Place]
<h1 class="ptitle"><<=$game.cabinName ?? ''>></h1>
<br />

<center>
	<<image 'places/cabin/medicine_mob.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

Word had gotten out that you had medicine. A knot of gaunt, ragged figures had gathered outside the gate by the time you noticed — not soldiers, not a raiding party, just people who'd run out of options.

<br /><br />

<<newguy>>
<<set _mmSpeaker = $tmpGuy>>
<<sayNpc _mmSpeaker>>
	We know you've got antibiotics in there. People are dying. We're not leaving without some.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />

<<set _mmCount = randomInteger(2, 4)>>
<<generateEnemies _mmCount 0>>
<<for _mmEi = 0; _mmEi < $enemies.length; _mmEi++>>
	<<set $enemies[_mmEi].strength = Math.max(10, Math.min($enemies[_mmEi].strength, 35))>>
<</for>>

<<set _mmGuards = setup.getPersonsForLocation($guests, 'guard')>>

<div id="mm_fight">
	<<link 'Drive them off'>>
		<<fight $enemies 'Wood cabin' 'Event - Medicine mob - lost' false _mmGuards>>
		<<set $fight.skipEndingLost = true>>
	<</link>>
</div>
<<if setup.cabinInventory.count('antibiotics') >= 2>>
	<div id="mm_pay">
		<<linkreplace 'Hand over 2 antibiotics to make them leave'>>
			<<run $('#mm_fight').hide()>>
			<<run setup.cabinInventory.drop('antibiotics', 2)>>
			You passed the bottles over the gate. The speaker checked them, nodded once, and the group melted back into the wastes without another word.
			<br /><br />
			<<set $player.goodwill += 2>>
			<<link 'Go back inside'>>
				<<goto 'Wood cabin'>>
			<</link>>
		<</linkreplace>>
	</div>
<</if>>
